tps://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9rBvjHM22DEQ7kNvwHkOnfp&_nc_oc=AdoRjwG1IWC6X7gpN6ZBb3VgQPlujepG3FaBlcWAQCf9aHpoNm0VQA4NVclKSQx5m-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJLx5fHZjyCWJ27MMCRoiDkIVi6QKQ4xdmVWGhDDNk7tA&oe=6AA5426E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=efwQbdsOMTAQ7kNvwGS0dCc&_nc_oc=AdocF-DxRCOAjggDp27duiC1Ju77LWBAO-fw-M0aNfOSBJuYnKmG1ol8YvZJdA3aqNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIbwrE4rke9dLbr6rUGAWZpVQdfiUQx0Z9uXVySQ1XwCw&oe=6AA56F0A"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PuA9qL-4A4UQ7kNvwEAqwb1&_nc_oc=AdrcZCZ7xxJG6QvUm2ZQ0EfbptsygQlUTPezKI0B6WJcwrmWwPG36XYxcYnE5zkyghw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIM3t_f1rhNGIMSxMzqPR14nxC8rzRz606--0FvL44wlw&oe=6AA55E2B"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_gR9O3x2yQwQ7kNvwE7ABFC&_nc_oc=Adoo3dCapCdTKjTRlKC8Avw9B3buYnAyEGqy4DcQMHQc6LSrDn_aU6JZF70lenQmuK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK9N-8W4RE_q-IwEIkFJe-jBT5opfbK2Rzzo9fpIrsr7w&oe=6AA54B31"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v_vgmoGci2oQ7kNvwFaVdD1&_nc_oc=Adqh3pU7sqPDAaJfTv18VUK5A8Wg5-vBgyC88Bn2e0IqN-xhetHK2XrPPJzj-yKGmTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLfozRph_Nax5bGVjbogPLAmI8aljksxZxV7mVn3gRbTg&oe=6AA54AF8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv